// 5 real damage-dealing affinities (Neutral = no element). Fire/Ice/Rock/Lightning each keep their
// own baseline status on landing (Burn/Slow/Intimidate/Electrified); only Void has none - its
// identity is a hand-authored WeaponDataAsset trait instead (a Void gun starting with Pierce, its own
// flavor being inward displacement/negative knockback, not a status). Landing a second element whose
// pairing status is already active on the target fires an elemental reaction immediately - Burn+Chill
// ->Thermal Shock, Burn+Shock->Overload, Chill+Shock->Static Collapse - see
// docs/elemental-reactions.md. Lightning appended at the end (not inserted alongside Rock/Void) to
// avoid renumbering Void's existing ordinal in already-serialized assets.
enum ElementType : Byte
{
    Neutral,
    Fire,
    Ice,
    Rock,
    Void,
    Lightning
}
